2:T486,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/articulate-game-voiceover#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/articulate-game-voiceover","headline":"Articulate Game Voiceover","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/articulate-game-voiceover","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.webp"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Articulate Game Voiceover - Describe as many card entries as possible to your team mates in 30 seconds without giving begins with or sounds like clues.","datePublished":"2017-08-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2017-08-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["commercial children energetic"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/articulate-game-voiceover.jpg"}}4:T428,<h2>Smyths Toys Voice</h2>
<p>I provided voiceover for an TV ad for the kids' edition of Articulate, one of the most popular board games in the World. Over the years, I've provided voiceover for lots of toy commercials, including plenty of ads for <a href="https://www.smythstoys.com" target="_blank" title="Smyths Toys Official site" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smyths Toys</a>.<br>
I have lots of experience working with toy companies and my voice is used by some major <a href="/gooey-louie-voiceover" target="_blank" title="Ideal Toys Gooey Louie">toy brands</a> worldwide, which makes me really proud. I can bring warmth and energy to the script and add that little bit of sparkle to your campaign.<br>
The toy industry is a big part of my workload and it's just as fun as it sounds. Please feel free to check out some of my <a href="/voiceover-news" target="_blank" title="My Voiceover News Blogs">other work</a> to see if my voice is right for your <a href="/spiderman-car-voiceover" target="_blank" title="Spiderman Toy">toy</a>, game, promo or brand.</p>7:["slug","articulate-game-voiceover","d"]
